  <config><![CDATA[{
  "published": true,
  "game_id": 74,
  "created_at": "2025-11-13T03:53:50.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Movie Spoiler Checker\r\n\r\n\r\n**Background:**\r\nYou're building a simple app that checks whether it's safe to post about a movie online.\r\nThe flowchart shows two decisions:\r\n\r\n1. Have you finished the movie?\r\n2. Does the post have spoiler tags?\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\nUse **AI Chat** to help you understand the flowchart and translate it into code. Your code will use **nested `if/else` statements** to decide which image to **show** based on the user's answers.\r\n\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n:::details [**Need a hint?**]\r\n   * Each diamond represents one `if/else`.\r\n   * Each leaf represents a visible outcome.\r\n   * Try using `.classList.replace(\"hide\", \"show\")` to display the right image.\r\n:::\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "outline",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
      "allowMultipleAttempts": false,
      "placeholderText": "",
      "multipleChoiceOptions": [
        ""
      ],
      "freeResponseHeight": 50,
      "codeEditableAfterSubmit": false
    },
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <title>Movie Spoiler Checker</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"image-section\">\n        <img id=\"img-finished-spoiler\"     class=\"hide\" src=\"finished-spoiler.png\"     alt=\"Finished + Spoilers\">\n        <img id=\"img-finished-nospoiler\"   class=\"hide\" src=\"finished-nospoiler.png\"   alt=\"Finished + No Spoilers\">\n        <img id=\"img-unfinished-spoiler\"   class=\"hide\" src=\"unfinished-spoiler.png\"   alt=\"Unfinished + Spoilers\">\n        <img id=\"img-unfinished-nospoiler\" class=\"hide\" src=\"unfinished-nospoiler.png\" alt=\"Unfinished + No Spoilers\">\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"questions-section\">\n        <div class=\"question-group\">\n          <p class=\"question-text\">Have you finished the movie?</p>\n          <div class=\"button-group\">\n            <button id=\"movie-no\">No</button>\n            <button id=\"movie-yes\">Yes</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"question-group\">\n          <p class=\"question-text\">Does the post contain spoiler tags?</p>\n          <div class=\"button-group\">\n            <button id=\"spoiler-no\">No</button>\n            <button id=\"spoiler-yes\">Yes</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// State variables\nlet finishedMovie = true;\nlet hasSpoilerTags = true;\n\n// Selectors for the buttons\nconst movieYesBtn   = document.getElementById(\"movie-yes\");\nconst movieNoBtn    = document.getElementById(\"movie-no\");\nconst spoilerYesBtn = document.getElementById(\"spoiler-yes\");\nconst spoilerNoBtn  = document.getElementById(\"spoiler-no\");\n\n// Selectors for the images (initially hidden)\nconst imgFinishedSpoiler     = document.getElementById(\"img-finished-spoiler\");\nconst imgFinishedNoSpoiler   = document.getElementById(\"img-finished-nospoiler\");\nconst imgUnfinishedSpoiler   = document.getElementById(\"img-unfinished-spoiler\");\nconst imgUnfinishedNoSpoiler = document.getElementById(\"img-unfinished-nospoiler\");\n\n\n// Use this function to hide all images\nconst hideAllImages = () => {\n  imgFinishedSpoiler.classList.replace(\"show\", \"hide\");\n  imgFinishedNoSpoiler.classList.replace(\"show\", \"hide\");\n  imgUnfinishedSpoiler.classList.replace(\"show\", \"hide\");\n  imgUnfinishedNoSpoiler.classList.replace(\"show\", \"hide\");\n};\n\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "body {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 20px;\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n\n.image-section {\n  width: 100%;\n  background-color: #e8e8e8;\n  border: 1px solid #ccc;\n  min-height: 300px;\n}\n\n\nbutton {\n  background-color: white;\n  border: 2px solid #333;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 8px 20px;\n  margin-right: 10px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background-color: #f0f0f0;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n  background-color: #90ee90;\n}\n\n\n/* ----- Visibility Control ----- */\n\n.hide {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.show {\n  display: block;\n  opacity: 1;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
